# ── Workspace ↔ monitor bindings (optional) ───────────────────────────────
# Pin workspaces to a specific monitor so they don't jump around when you plug
# or unplug an external display. Machine-local (gitignored, seeded from this
# .default by install.sh); nwg-displays can also write here.
#
# Example (workspaces 1–5 on the laptop, 6–10 on the external):
#   workspace = 1, monitor:eDP-2, default:true
#   workspace = 6, monitor:HDMI-A-1, default:true
